{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.998,"lines":[{"text":"J'ai grandi sous un toit qui pleurait plus fort que ma mère","t":15.14,"e":17.44,"w":[["J'ai",15.14,15.26],["grandi",15.3,15.58],["sous",15.62,15.78],["un",15.84,15.92],["toit",15.98,16.1],["qui",16.14,16.22],["pleurait",16.3,16.58],["plus",16.62,16.74],["fort",16.8,16.92],["que",16.96,17.04],["ma",17.1,17.22],["mère",17.28,17.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Elle comptait les pièces jaunes comme on égrène des prières","t":19.08,"e":21.36,"w":[["Elle",19.08,19.2],["comptait",19.24,19.52],["les",19.54,19.66],["pièces",19.7,19.92],["jaunes",19.96,20.2],["comme",20.26,20.4],["on",20.44,20.54],["égrène",20.6,20.86],["des",20.88,20.98],["prières",21.02,21.36]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le frigo faisait écho, le vide remplissait l'assiette","t":22.88,"e":25.58,"w":[["Le",22.88,22.94],["frigo",23,23.3],["faisait",23.36,23.64],["écho",23.74,24.04],["le",24.16,24.26],["vide",24.32,24.46],["remplissait",24.5,24.92],["l'assiette",24.96,25.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On mangeait l'espoir en sauce et le silence en serviette","t":26.82,"e":29.56,"w":[["On",26.82,26.9],["mangeait",26.94,27.22],["l'espoir",27.24,27.6],["en",27.64,27.72],["sauce",27.8,28.12],["et",28.16,28.22],["le",28.26,28.36],["silence",28.44,28.74],["en",28.78,28.84],["serviette",28.9,29.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Peine, pluie, pression : prison de papier, porte en carton","t":30.6,"e":33.72,"w":[["Peine",30.6,30.82],["pluie",31.06,31.28],["pression",31.5,31.84],["prison",32.04,32.32],["de",32.36,32.44],["papier",32.54,32.84],["porte",33.02,33.2],["en",33.22,33.28],["carton",33.34,33.72]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J'ai su épeler souffrance avant de savoir mon prénom","t":34.64,"e":37.74,"w":[["J'ai",34.64,34.76],["su",34.84,34.96],["épeler",35.06,35.4],["souffrance",35.44,36.14],["avant",36.22,36.4],["de",36.46,36.54],["savoir",36.64,37.06],["mon",37.1,37.22],["prénom",37.26,37.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J'ai le cœur en cicatrice et la mémoire en cellule","t":38.58,"e":41.18,"w":[["J'ai",38.58,38.7],["le",38.74,38.84],["cœur",38.9,39.06],["en",39.1,39.18],["cicatrice",39.22,39.92],["et",39.98,40.04],["la",40.08,40.16],["mémoire",40.22,40.54],["en",40.56,40.64],["cellule",40.7,41.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je souris pour les autres, mais chez moi la lumière recule","t":41.68,"e":45.06,"w":[["Je",41.68,41.78],["souris",41.88,42.16],["pour",42.2,42.32],["les",42.38,42.52],["autres",42.58,42.78],["mais",43.02,43.1],["chez",43.12,43.26],["moi",43.34,43.48],["la",43.88,43.98],["lumière",44.16,44.64],["recule",44.64,45.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le malheur toque sans prévenir, il connaît notre étage","t":46.14,"e":49.6,"w":[["Le",46.14,46.22],["malheur",46.3,46.66],["toque",46.8,47.0],["sans",46.94,47.04],["prévenir",47.08,47.5],["il",48.14,48.22],["connaît",48.28,48.68],["notre",48.76,48.96],["étage",49.12,49.6]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"Il entre sans s'essuyer les pieds, il s'installe comme un héritage","t":49.66,"e":53.58,"w":[["Il",49.66,49.72],["entre",49.76,49.98],["sans",50.04,50.16],["s'essuyer",50.22,50.68],["les",50.72,50.84],["pieds",50.9,51.04],["il",51.06,51.14],["s'installe",51.2,51.74],["comme",52.2,52.38],["un",52.46,52.68],["héritage",52.7,53.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Si je tombe à genoux, c'est pour prier, pas pour céder","t":54.32,"e":57.56,"w":[["Si",54.32,54.42],["je",54.46,54.58],["tombe",54.64,54.84],["à",54.88,54.94],["genoux",54.98,55.56],["c'est",55.64,55.78],["pour",55.84,56.04],["prier",56.1,56.52],["pas",56.62,56.76],["pour",56.82,57.02],["céder",57.1,57.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La vie m'a mis des coups, mais j'ai jamais demandé pitié","t":57.96,"e":61.5,"w":[["La",57.96,58.04],["vie",58.1,58.22],["m'a",58.28,58.4],["mis",58.6,58.72],["des",58.78,59],["coups",59.1,59.36],["mais",59.42,59.52],["j'ai",59.54,59.7],["jamais",59.76,60.34],["demandé",60.42,60.96],["pitié",61.06,61.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans ce monde de loups, j'avance avec la foi pour bouclier","t":62.04,"e":65.3,"w":[["Dans",62.04,62.16],["ce",62.2,62.44],["monde",62.52,62.66],["de",62.72,62.94],["loups",63.02,63.3],["j'avance",63.34,63.7],["avec",63.78,63.98],["la",64.04,64.12],["foi",64.2,64.34],["pour",64.5,64.64],["bouclier",64.7,65.3]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Si je tombe à genoux, c'est que Dieu m'apprend à me relever","t":65.98,"e":69.22,"w":[["Si",65.98,66.08],["je",66.16,66.38],["tombe",66.46,66.64],["à",66.68,66.74],["genoux",66.76,67.18],["c'est",67.28,67.38],["que",67.44,67.54],["Dieu",67.58,67.7],["m'apprend",67.76,68.22],["à",68.3,68.36],["me",68.42,68.54],["relever",68.6,69.22]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La société me sourit avec les dents d'un requin","t":70.1,"e":72.5,"w":[["La",70.1,70.16],["société",70.22,70.66],["me",70.7,70.8],["sourit",70.9,71.22],["avec",71.32,71.54],["les",71.58,71.68],["dents",71.7,71.82],["d'un",71.86,72],["requin",72.04,72.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Elle te vend le rêve en vitrine, mais te refuse le pain","t":73.04,"e":76.44,"w":[["Elle",73.04,73.14],["te",73.18,73.28],["vend",73.34,73.48],["le",73.52,73.62],["rêve",73.68,73.84],["en",73.88,73.96],["vitrine",74,74.38],["mais",75.16,75.44],["te",75.5,75.58],["refuse",75.64,75.94],["le",75.98,76.08],["pain",76.14,76.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"L'ascenseur social est en panne depuis des années","t":77.12,"e":80.38,"w":[["L'ascenseur",77.12,77.54],["social",77.6,77.94],["est",77.98,78.08],["en",78.12,78.22],["panne",78.3,79.56],["depuis",79.58,79.86],["des",79.9,80.06],["années",80.12,80.38]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Alors on monte par l'escalier de secours, les genoux usés","t":80.66,"e":84.36,"w":[["Alors",80.66,80.9],["on",80.92,80.98],["monte",81.06,81.32],["par",81.42,81.64],["l'escalier",81.68,82.16],["de",82.2,82.28],["secours",82.38,82.98],["les",83.52,83.6],["genoux",83.64,84],["usés",84.06,84.36]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Métro, boulot, dodo, découvert","t":84.68,"e":88.06,"w":[["Métro",84.68,84.94],["boulot",86.96,87.22],["dodo",87.3,87.54],["découvert",87.62,88.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Loyer, facture, relance, galère","t":88.1,"e":89.88,"w":[["Loyer",88.1,88.34],["facture",88.58,88.88],["relance",89.12,89.4],["galère",89.58,89.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils comptent nos voix aux élections, jamais quand on pleure","t":89.92,"e":92.34,"w":[["Ils",89.92,90],["comptent",90.06,90.22],["nos",90.38,90.5],["voix",90.56,90.7],["aux",90.76,90.88],["élections",90.98,91.32],["jamais",91.38,91.66],["quand",91.7,91.86],["on",91.88,91.96],["pleure",92.02,92.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils vendent la liberté à crédit, payable en heures","t":93.88,"e":96.28,"w":[["Ils",93.88,93.94],["vendent",94,94.16],["la",94.2,94.28],["liberté",94.34,94.78],["à",94.84,94.9],["crédit",94.96,95.28],["payable",95.48,95.82],["en",95.86,95.96],["heures",96,96.28]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On a des milliers d'amis en ligne et personne pour tenir la main","t":97.32,"e":100.04,"w":[["On",97.32,97.4],["a",97.48,97.56],["des",97.6,97.72],["milliers",97.76,98.04],["d'amis",98.08,98.42],["en",98.48,98.56],["ligne",98.62,98.78],["et",98.8,98.88],["personne",98.92,99.22],["pour",99.24,99.36],["tenir",99.42,99.68],["la",99.74,99.82],["main",99.88,100.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les écrans nous gavent, mais les cœurs restent à jeun","t":100.26,"e":102.02,"w":[["Les",100.26,100.4],["écrans",100.46,100.68],["nous",100.72,100.82],["gavent",100.9,101.04],["mais",101.08,101.18],["les",101.22,101.32],["cœurs",101.38,101.52],["restent",101.54,101.72],["à",101.78,101.82],["jeun",101.86,102.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les loups portent des costumes, on les applaudit au journal","t":102.08,"e":104.62,"w":[["Les",102.08,102.16],["loups",102.2,102.32],["portent",102.38,102.64],["des",102.68,102.8],["costumes",102.84,103.2],["on",103.22,103.3],["les",103.36,103.5],["applaudit",103.56,104],["au",104.04,104.1],["journal",104.16,104.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les brebis qu'ils ont tondues les remercient pour le châle","t":105.5,"e":108.62,"w":[["Les",105.5,105.6],["brebis",105.64,105.94],["qu'ils",105.96,106.12],["ont",106.16,106.24],["tondues",106.3,106.76],["les",107.1,107.22],["remercient",107.28,107.88],["pour",107.92,108.04],["le",108.08,108.16],["châle",108.22,108.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Si je tombe à genoux, c'est pour prier, pas pour céder","t":109.26,"e":112.5,"w":[["Si",109.26,109.36],["je",109.42,109.68],["tombe",109.74,109.92],["à",109.96,110.02],["genoux",110.06,110.5],["c'est",110.72,110.86],["pour",110.92,111.1],["prier",111.22,111.62],["pas",111.72,111.84],["pour",111.9,112.1],["céder",112.18,112.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La vie m'a mis des coups, mais j'ai jamais demandé pitié","t":113.04,"e":116.52,"w":[["La",113.04,113.14],["vie",113.2,113.32],["m'a",113.36,113.6],["mis",113.66,113.8],["des",113.86,114.08],["coups",114.18,114.44],["mais",114.5,114.62],["j'ai",114.64,114.78],["jamais",114.86,115.42],["demandé",115.48,116.04],["pitié",116.12,116.52]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans ce monde de loups, j'avance avec la foi pour bouclier","t":117.12,"e":120.38,"w":[["Dans",117.12,117.24],["ce",117.3,117.54],["monde",117.6,117.8],["de",117.8,117.92],["loups",118.12,118.38],["j'avance",118.42,118.78],["avec",118.86,119.06],["la",119.12,119.22],["foi",119.28,119.52],["pour",119.6,119.72],["bouclier",119.8,120.38]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Si je tombe à genoux, c'est que Dieu m'apprend à me relever","t":121.06,"e":124.3,"w":[["Si",121.06,121.16],["je",121.22,121.48],["tombe",121.54,121.7],["à",121.76,121.82],["genoux",121.84,122.24],["c'est",122.36,122.48],["que",122.52,122.62],["Dieu",122.66,122.78],["m'apprend",122.84,123.28],["à",123.38,123.42],["me",123.5,123.62],["relever",123.68,124.3]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Seigneur, je te donne la peine que j'arrive plus à porter","t":125.3,"e":128.64,"w":[["Seigneur",125.3,125.6],["je",125.66,125.76],["te",125.8,125.92],["donne",125.98,126.24],["la",126.3,126.4],["peine",126.5,126.78],["que",126.82,126.92],["j'arrive",126.96,127.42],["plus",127.48,127.64],["à",127.72,127.8],["porter",127.96,128.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Prends la nuit, laisse-moi l'aube, apprends-moi à pardonner","t":129.1,"e":132.56,"w":[["Prends",129.1,129.26],["la",129.3,129.38],["nuit",129.42,129.54],["laisse-moi",129.58,129.9],["l'aube",129.94,130.26],["apprends-moi",130.66,131.18],["à",131.46,131.54],["pardonner",131.6,132.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Élie voulait mourir sous un genêt, vidé par la route","t":133.28,"e":136.06,"w":[["Élie",133.28,133.48],["voulait",133.54,133.78],["mourir",133.86,134.12],["sous",134.18,134.32],["un",134.36,134.44],["genêt",134.5,134.78],["vidé",135.18,135.44],["par",135.5,135.6],["la",135.66,135.78],["route",135.84,136.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Un ange lui a tendu du pain, il s'est relevé malgré le doute","t":136.7,"e":140,"w":[["Un",136.7,136.8],["ange",136.84,136.98],["lui",137.02,137.12],["a",137.16,137.24],["tendu",137.3,137.56],["du",137.62,137.72],["pain",137.82,138.2],["il",138.46,138.54],["s'est",138.58,138.7],["relevé",138.76,139.18],["malgré",139.24,139.52],["le",139.58,139.68],["doute",139.74,140]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Paul disait : quand je suis faible, c'est alors que je suis fort","t":140.76,"e":143.98,"w":[["Paul",140.76,140.92],["disait",141.08,141.34],["quand",141.36,141.48],["je",141.52,141.54],["suis",141.54,141.66],["faible",141.76,142.02],["c'est",142.88,143.02],["alors",143.1,143.28],["que",143.32,143.4],["je",143.44,143.44],["suis",143.46,143.62],["fort",143.7,143.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J'ai compris le verset le jour où il me restait que la prière et mon corps","t":144.32,"e":147.92,"w":[["J'ai",144.32,144.46],["compris",144.5,144.8],["le",144.84,144.92],["verset",144.98,145.28],["le",145.32,145.4],["jour",145.48,145.68],["où",145.7,145.78],["il",145.8,145.88],["me",145.92,146.02],["restait",146.04,146.38],["que",146.64,146.76],["la",146.8,146.9],["prière",146.94,147.28],["et",147.32,147.4],["mon",147.44,147.58],["corps",147.64,147.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La foi c'est pas l'absence de peur, c'est avancer malgré la peur","t":147.96,"e":151.82,"w":[["La",147.96,148.06],["foi",148.14,148.36],["c'est",148.44,148.56],["pas",148.62,148.74],["l'absence",148.78,149.36],["de",149.42,149.48],["peur",149.6,149.8],["c'est",150.08,150.24],["avancer",150.32,150.68],["malgré",150.76,151.2],["la",151.24,151.38],["peur",151.56,151.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le courage c'est un cœur qui tremble mais qui se lève avant l'heure","t":152.04,"e":155.74,"w":[["Le",152.04,152.14],["courage",152.2,152.52],["c'est",152.54,152.72],["un",152.78,152.88],["cœur",153.02,153.26],["qui",153.3,153.44],["tremble",153.5,153.82],["mais",154.02,154.12],["qui",154.14,154.24],["se",154.32,154.42],["lève",154.52,154.98],["avant",155.08,155.4],["l'heure",155.46,155.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je prie, je plie, mais je romps pas, comme le roseau dans la tempête","t":156.3,"e":159.48,"w":[["Je",156.3,156.4],["prie",156.46,156.7],["je",156.78,156.9],["plie",156.96,157.08],["mais",157.12,157.22],["je",157.28,157.38],["romps",157.46,157.58],["pas",157.64,157.76],["comme",157.96,158.08],["le",158.12,158.2],["roseau",158.26,158.56],["dans",158.6,158.7],["la",158.74,158.86],["tempête",158.92,159.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je tiens, je viens, je reviens, je deviens ce que la douleur m'apprend, je m'entête","t":159.86,"e":163.48,"w":[["Je",159.86,159.88],["tiens",159.92,160.16],["je",160.22,160.3],["viens",160.4,160.64],["je",160.7,160.72],["reviens",160.76,161.12],["je",161.14,161.18],["deviens",161.24,161.5],["ce",161.52,161.56],["que",161.58,161.66],["la",161.72,161.84],["douleur",161.9,162.14],["m'apprend",162.2,162.62],["je",162.7,162.78],["m'entête",162.84,163.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils ont creusé ma tombe, ils ont oublié que j'étais une graine","t":163.94,"e":167.24,"w":[["Ils",163.94,164.16],["ont",164.18,164.28],["creusé",164.34,164.58],["ma",164.64,164.76],["tombe",164.84,165.16],["ils",165.2,165.32],["ont",165.36,165.48],["oublié",165.52,166.06],["que",166.12,166.22],["j'étais",166.24,166.56],["une",166.6,166.72],["graine",166.78,167.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Sous la terre j'ai pris racine, maintenant je pousse à travers leur haine","t":167.8,"e":171.18,"w":[["Sous",167.8,167.9],["la",167.94,168.04],["terre",168.1,168.22],["j'ai",168.24,168.38],["pris",168.42,168.54],["racine",168.6,169.06],["maintenant",169.1,169.36],["je",169.42,169.52],["pousse",169.62,169.92],["à",170.04,170.16],["travers",170.24,170.5],["leur",170.54,170.68],["haine",170.74,171.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Si je tombe c'est à genoux, et à genoux on est plus près du ciel","t":171.74,"e":174.92,"w":[["Si",171.74,171.82],["je",171.86,171.98],["tombe",172.04,172.32],["c'est",172.38,172.52],["à",172.6,172.64],["genoux",172.68,173.14],["et",173.22,173.32],["à",173.4,173.44],["genoux",173.5,173.88],["on",173.92,173.98],["est",174.02,174.12],["plus",174.18,174.28],["près",174.32,174.44],["du",174.5,174.6],["ciel",174.66,174.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le sol m'a appris la prière, la prière m'a donné des ailes","t":175.52,"e":179.1,"w":[["Le",175.52,175.6],["sol",175.68,175.84],["m'a",175.88,176],["appris",176.06,176.28],["la",176.34,176.42],["prière",176.48,176.82],["la",177.34,177.42],["prière",177.48,177.94],["m'a",178,178.1],["donné",178.16,178.42],["des",178.48,178.66],["ailes",178.72,179.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Si je tombe à genoux, c'est pour prier, pas pour céder","t":180.12,"e":183.48,"w":[["Si",180.12,180.26],["je",180.3,180.56],["tombe",180.64,180.78],["à",180.86,180.9],["genoux",180.94,181.5],["c'est",181.6,181.74],["pour",181.8,182.02],["prier",182.08,182.5],["pas",182.6,182.72],["pour",182.78,182.98],["céder",183.08,183.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La vie m'a mis des coups, mais j'ai jamais demandé pitié","t":183.94,"e":187.54,"w":[["La",183.94,184.04],["vie",184.1,184.22],["m'a",184.28,184.52],["mis",184.6,184.72],["des",184.78,185],["coups",185.08,185.36],["mais",185.42,185.54],["j'ai",185.56,185.7],["jamais",185.78,186.34],["demandé",186.4,186.92],["pitié",187.04,187.54]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans ce monde de loups, j'avance avec la foi pour bouclier","t":188.06,"e":191.42,"w":[["Dans",188.06,188.2],["ce",188.24,188.46],["monde",188.52,188.74],["de",188.76,188.96],["loups",189.04,189.32],["j'avance",189.36,189.7],["avec",189.78,189.98],["la",190.04,190.16],["foi",190.22,190.46],["pour",190.52,190.66],["bouclier",190.72,191.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Si je tombe à genoux, c'est que Dieu m'apprend à me relever","t":192.02,"e":195.34,"w":[["Si",192.02,192.14],["je",192.18,192.44],["tombe",192.52,192.68],["à",192.74,192.78],["genoux",192.84,193.22],["c'est",193.32,193.44],["que",193.5,193.58],["Dieu",193.64,193.76],["m'apprend",193.8,194.26],["à",194.36,194.4],["me",194.48,194.6],["relever",194.66,195.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"À genoux, mais debout","t":204.4,"e":221.28,"w":[["À",204.4,204.44],["genoux",204.5,204.76],["mais",208.12,208.22],["debout",208.26,221.28]],"ok":1.0}]}